Forest Lord Cryptwood Connection	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:The forest lord gains DR equal to his level as well as a bonus to saving throws equal to his level against damage and effects that originate from cryptwood effects.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc6	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_CRYPTWOOD_DR|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_CRYPTWOOD_DR|SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_CRYPTWOOD_SAVE|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_CRYPTWOOD_SAVE|SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL
Forest Lord Favored Terrain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:The forest lord gains a favored terrain, as the Ranger class feature. However, the forest lord can only choose either forest, jungle, or swamp as a favored terrain, unless she already possesses all three. At 5th level, the forest lord gains a second favored terrain, and may increase the bonuses associated with one terrain by +2. The forest lord’s class levels count as ranger levels for the purpose of gaining additional favored terrains if the forest lord gains them from another source.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc7
Forest Lord Master Leaper	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:The forest lord gains the Talented Leaper feat, even if he does not meet the prerequisites. If she already possesses this feat, she may immediately retrain it. In addition, the forest lord gains a bonus to Acrobatics checks made to jump equal to twice her forest lord level.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc8	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_JUMP_BONUS|0	BONUS:VAR|SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_JUMP_BONUS|2*SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL
Forest Lord Forest’s Strength	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:At 2nd level the forest lord gains a +2 inherent bonus to Strength and a climb speed of 20 ft. At 4th level, the inherent bonus increases to +4 and the Climb speed increases to 30 ft. If the forest lord already has a Climb speed, add these Climb speeds together.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc9	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_STRENGTH_INHERENT|if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=5,6,if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=4,4,2))	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_CLIMB_SPEED|if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=5,40,if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=4,30,20))
Forest Lord Master Geomancer	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:The distance at which the forest lord can use geomancing increases by one step: Close range becomes medium range, medium range becomes long range, and long range becomes extreme range (1000 ft. +100 ft. per level). If using the Rapid Growth advanced talent, double its area.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc10
Forest Lord Forest’s Strength	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:At 2nd level the forest lord gains a +2 inherent bonus to Strength and a climb speed of 20 ft. At 4th level, the inherent bonus increases to +4 and the Climb speed increases to 30 ft. If the forest lord already has a Climb speed, add these Climb speeds together.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc9	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_STRENGTH_INHERENT|if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=5,6,if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=4,4,2))	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_CLIMB_SPEED|if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=5,40,if(SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_LEVEL>=4,30,20))
Forest Lord Favored Terrain	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:The forest lord gains a favored terrain, as the Ranger class feature. However, the forest lord can only choose either forest, jungle, or swamp as a favored terrain, unless she already possesses all three. At 5th level, the forest lord gains a second favored terrain, and may increase the bonuses associated with one terrain by +2. The forest lord’s class levels count as ranger levels for the purpose of gaining additional favored terrains if the forest lord gains them from another source.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc7
Forest Lord Forest Heart	CATEGORY:Special Ability	TYPE:ForestLordClassFeature	DESC:At 5th level the forest lord’s inherent bonus to Strength increases to +6 and their Climb speed increases to 40 ft. The forest lord is considered a native inhabitant of any cryptwood he enters; he does not suffer adverse effects and instead gains any templates or bonuses granted to animals within the area.	SOURCEPAGE:https://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/forest-lord#toc11	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_HEART_STRENGTH|6	DEFINE:SPHERES_FOREST_LORD_HEART_CLIMB|40
